res "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[12]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"do","s":["H6213"],"a":[13]},{"t":" according to all that I "},{"t":"commanded","s":["H6680"],"a":[16]},{"t":" you."}]},{"n":22,"text":"The sound of war is in the land, And great destruction.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"sound","s":["H6963"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"war","s":["H4421"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is in the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"destruction","s":["H7667"],"a":[3]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":23,"text":"How the hammer of the whole earth Is cut down and broken! How Babylon has become an astonishment Among the nations!","tok":[{"t":"How the "},{"t":"hammer","s":["H6360"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of the whole "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[5]},{"t":" Is cut down and "},{"t":"broken","s":["H7665"],"a":[2]},{"t":"! How "},{"t":"Babylon","s":["H0894"],"a":[9]},{"t":" has become an astonishment Among the "},{"t":"nations","s":["H1471"],"a":[10]},{"t":"!"}]},{"n":24,"text":"I have set a snare for you, and you also have been taken captive, O Babylon, and you did not know; You were found, and you also were seized, Because you engaged in war with Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"I have set a "},{"t":"snare","s":["H3369"],"a":[0]},{"t":" for you, and you also have been "},{"t":"taken","s":["H3920"],"a":[3]},{"t":" captive, O "},{"t":"Babylon","s":["H0894"],"a":[4]},{"t":", and you did not know; You were "},{"t":"found","s":["H4672"],"a":[8]},{"t":", and you also were seized, Because you engaged in war with "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":25,"text":"Jehovah has opened His armory And has brought out the weapons of His wrath, For this is the work of the Lord Jehovah of hosts Against the land of the Chaldeans.","tok":[{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"opened","s":["H6605"],"a":[0]},{"t":" His armory And has brought out the "},{"t":"weapons","s":["H3627"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of His wrath, For this is the "},{"t":