":"vengeance","s":["H5360"],"a":[11]},{"t":" for His "},{"t":"temple","s":["H1964"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":29,"text":"Summon archers against Babylon, All those who bend the bow. Encamp against her all around; Let there be no escape. Recompense her according to her work; According to all that she has done, so do to her. For she has acted proudly against Jehovah, Against the Holy One of Israel.","tok":[{"t":"Summon","s":["H8085"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"archers","s":["H7228"],"a":[3]},{"t":" against "},{"t":"Babylon","s":["H0894"],"a":[2]},{"t":", All those who "},{"t":"bend","s":["H1869"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"bow","s":["H7198"],"a":[6]},{"t":". Encamp against her all around; Let there be no "},{"t":"escape","s":["H6413"],"a":[12]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Recompense","s":["H7999"],"a":[13]},{"t":" her according to her "},{"t":"work","s":["H6467"],"a":[15]},{"t":"; According to all that she has "},{"t":"done","s":["H6213"],"a":[18]},{"t":", so "},{"t":"do","s":["H6213"],"a":[19]},{"t":" to her. For she has acted "},{"t":"proudly","s":["H2102"],"a":[24]},{"t":" against "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[23]},{"t":", Against the Holy "},{"t":"One","s":["H6918"],"a":[26]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[27]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":30,"text":"Therefore her young men will fall in her open squares, And all her men of war will be silenced in that day, Declares Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore her young "},{"t":"men","s":["H0970"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"fall","s":["H5307"],"a":[1]},{"t":" in her open squares, And all her "},{"t":"men","s":["H0582"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"war","s":["H4421"],"a":[6]},{"t":" will be silenced in that "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[8]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Declares","s":["H5002"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":31,"text":"Indeed, I am against you, O Pride, Declares the Lord Jehovah of hosts; For your day has come, The time that I punish you.","tok":[{"t":"Indeed, I am against you, O Pride, Declares the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3069"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; For your "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[9]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[8]},{"t":", The "},{"t":"time","s":["H6256"],"a":[10]},{"t":" that I punish you."}]},{"n":32,"text":"And Pride will stumble and fall, And there will be no one to raise him up. And I will kindle a fire in his cities, And it will devour all that is around him.","tok":[{"t":"And Pride will "},{"t":"stumble","s":["H3782"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"fall","s":["H5307"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And there will be no one to raise him "},{"t":"up","s":["H6965"],"a":[5]},{"t":". And I will "},{"t":"kindle","s":["H3341"],"a":[6]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"fire","s":["H0784"],"a":[7]},{"t":" in his "},{"t":"cities","s":["H5892"],"a":[8]},{"t":", And it will "},{"t":"devour","s":["H0398"],"a":[9]},{"t":" all that is around him."}]},{"n":33,"text":"Thus says Jehovah of hosts, The children of Israel And the children of Judah are oppressed together; And all who took them captive held them fast; They refused to let them go.","tok":[{"t":"Thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[3]},{"t":", The "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[6]},{"t":" And the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[8]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"oppressed","s":["H6231"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"together","s":["H3162"],"a":[9]},{"t":"; And all who took them "},{"t":"captive","s":["H7617"],"a":[11]},{"t":" held them "},{"t":"fast","s":["H2388"],"a":[12]},{"t":"; They "},{"t":"refused","s":["H3985"],"a":[14]},{"t":" to let them "},{"t":"go","s":["H7971"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":34,"text":"Their Redeemer is strong; Jehovah of hosts is His name. He will surely plead their cause, That He may