y will become like women. The sword is against her treasuries, And they will be plundered.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"sword","s":["H2719"],"a":[0]},{"t":" is against their "},{"t":"horses","s":["H5483"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and against their "},{"t":"chariots","s":["H7393"],"a":[4]},{"t":" And against all the mingled "},{"t":"people","s":["H6153"]},{"t":" who are in her "},{"t":"midst","s":["H8432"],"a":[9]},{"t":", And they will become like "},{"t":"women","s":["H0802"],"a":[11]},{"t":". The "},{"t":"sword","s":["H2719"],"a":[12]},{"t":" is against her "},{"t":"treasuries","s":["H0214"],"a":[14]},{"t":", And they will be plundered."}]},{"n":38,"text":"Drought is upon her waters, And they will dry up; For it is a land of graven images, And they are mad over terrifying idols.","tok":[{"t":"Drought","s":["H2721"],"a":[0]},{"t":" is upon her "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And they will dry "},{"t":"up","s":["H3001"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; For it is a "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of graven "},{"t":"images","s":["H6456"],"a":[6]},{"t":", And they are "},{"t":"mad","s":["H1984"],"a":[9]},{"t":" over terrifying "},{"t":"idols","s":["H0367"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":39,"text":"Therefore desert animals will dwell there with hyenas, And ostriches will dwell in her. It will not be inhabited forever; It will not be dwelt in from generation to generation.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore "},{"t":"desert","s":["H6728"],"a":[2]},{"t":" animals will "},{"t":"dwell","s":["H3427"],"a":[5]},{"t":" there with hyenas, And ostriches will "},{"t":"dwell","s":["H3427"],"a":[1]},{"t":" in her. It will not be "},{"t":"inhabited","s":["H3427"],"a":[10]},{"t":" forever; It will not be "},{"t":"dwelt","s":["H7931"],"a":[14]},{"t":" in from "},{"t":"generation","s":["H1755"],"a":[16]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"generation","s":["H1755"],"a":[17]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":40,"text":"As when God overthrew Sodom And Gomorrah with its neighbors, Declares Jehovah, So no one will dwell there; Nor will a son of man sojourn in it.","tok":[{"t":"As when "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"overthrew","s":["H4114"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Sodom","s":["H5467"],"a":[3]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"Gomorrah","s":["H6017"],"a":[5]},{"t":" with its neighbors, Declares "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":", So no one will "},{"t":"dwell","s":["H1481"],"a":[15]},{"t":" there; Nor will a "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[17]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[18]},{"t":" "},{"t":"sojourn","s":["H1481"],"a":[15]},{"t":" in it."}]},{"n":41,"text":"A people is now coming from the north, And a great nation and many kings Are stirring from the uttermost parts of the earth.","tok":[{"t":"A "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is now "},{"t":"coming","s":["H0935"],"a":[2]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"north","s":["H6828"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And a "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"nation","s":["H1471"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"many","s":["H7227"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"kings","s":["H4428"],"a":[6]},{"t":" Are stirring from the uttermost parts of the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":42,"text":"They grasp bow and spear; They are cruel and have no mercy. Their voice roars like the sea, And they ride upon horses, Set in array as a man for battle Against you, O daughter of Babylon.","tok":[{"t":"They grasp "},{"t":"bow","s":["H7198"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and spear; They are "},{"t":"cruel","s":["H0394"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and have no "},{"t":"mercy","s":["H7355"],"a":[6]},{"t":". Their "},{"t":"voice","s":["H6963"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"roars","s":["H1993"],"a":[9]},{"t":" like the "},{"t":"sea","s":["H3220"],"a":[8]},{"t":", And they "},{"t":"ride","s":["H7392"],"a":[12]},{"t":" upon "},{"t":"horses","s":["H5483"],"a":[11]},{"t":", Set in "},{"t":"array","s":["H6186"],"a":[13]},{"t":" as a "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[14]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"battle","s":["H4421"],"a":[15]},{"t":" Against you, O "},{"t":"daughter","s":["H1323"],"a":[17]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Babylon","s":["H0894"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":43,"text":"The king of Babylon has heard the report about them, And his hands are feeble; Distress has seized him, Pain like a woman in childbirth.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Babylon","s":["H0894"],"a":[2]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"heard","s":["H8085"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"report","s":["H8088"],"a":[4]},{"t":" about them, And his "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[6]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"feeble","s":["H7503"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; Distress has seized him, Pain like a woman in childbirth."}]},{"n":44,"text":"Indeed, one will come up like a lion From the majesty of the Jordan against a secure habitation; For I will suddenly make them run away from her; And whoever is chosen I will appoint over her. For who is like Me? And who can appoint Me a time? And who is that shepherd who can stand before Me?","tok":[{"t":"Indeed, one will come "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[2]},{"t":" like a "},{"t":"lion","s":["H0738"],"a":[1]},{"t":" From the "},{"t":"majesty","s":["H1347"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"Jordan","s":["H3383"],"a":[4]},{"t":" against a secure "},{"t":"habitation","s":["H5116"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; For I will "},{"t":"suddenly","s":["H7280"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"make","s":["H7323"],"a":[10]},{"t":" them run "},{"t":"away","s":["H7323"]},{"t":" from her; And whoever is "},{"t":"chosen","s":["H0977"],"a":[13]},{"t":" I will "},{"t":"appoint","s":["H6485"],"a":[15]},{"t":" over her. For who is like Me? And who can appoint Me a "},{"t":"time","s":["H3259"],"a":[20]},{"t":"? And who is that "},{"t":"shepherd","s":["H7462"],"a":[23]},{"t":" who can "},{"t":"stand","s":["H5975"],"a":[25]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[26]},{"t":" Me?"}]},{"n":45,"text":"Therefore hear the counsel of Jehovah, Which He purposed against Babylon, And His thoughts, which He has thought Against the land of the Chaldeans: Surely they will drag them off, the little ones of the flock; Surely He will make their habitation a desolation because of them.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"counsel","s":["H6098"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":", Which He "},{"t":"purposed","s":["H2803"],"a":[10]},{"t":" against "},{"t":"Babylon","s":["H0894"],"a":[7]},{"t":", And His thoughts, which He has thought Against the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"Chaldeans","s":["H3778"],"a":[13]},{"t":": Surely they will drag them off, the little ones of the "},{"t":"flock","s":["H6629"],"a":[18]},{"t":"; Surely He will make their "},{"t":"habitation","s":["H5116"],"a":[23]},{"t":" a desolation because of them."}]},{"n":46,"text":"At the sound of Babylon being seized The earth trembles, And a cry is heard among the nations.","tok":[{"t":"At the sound of "},{"t":"Babylon","s":["H0894"],"a":[2]},{"t":" being seized The "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"trembles","s":["H7493"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And a "},{"t":"cry","s":["H2201"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"heard","s":["H8085"],"a":[7]},{"t":" among the "},{"t":"nations","s":["H1471"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]}]}
